ation, automation, and electronic security systems, as well as undertakes the laying of overhead and underground optical fibre cable network for telecom operators. It also constructs manholes, sewerage treatment plants, pumping stations, structural facilities for sewerage, stormwater drainage systems, and screening chambers for combined or sanitary sewers, as well as pipe laying services. In addition, the company engages in the laying medium-density polyethylene for domestic and commercial gas supply. Annu Projects Limited was incorporated in 2003 and is based in New Delhi, India.","employees":null,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795529137},"analyst":null,"cap":"Penny","caFix":null,"fetched":1795529137,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"ANNU PROJECTS\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"ANNU PROJECTS LIMITED Share Price","s":"Upstox","d":1795488756,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE10bi1VNjlpRFFVUzZjZHljNGVyTjlZWnZFX3FvckxhOF8ydmpiZDFNWlo2SFBsY0xzd3pCUldQZktFbWRFTlJ0R2xuUW1ZcVo0bDdjamdheXhOYzJ2OFJQdHFqSzVXR3VaSUxCNQ?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Annu Projects sees Q4 surge, targets ₹2,000 crore order book by FY27 end","s":"scanx.trade","d":1795436030,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOMjJFOTBmbjRSbHJMZ1B5aEtLRkw5OC1zQ2hxUVJ3aGFoLWJITHgzdUlKRWNlVTZBZXBzRjdrVkJsblpGTWV1bkVMUm9Ncmc0UnRlQ3VmMmhwNFVDMHZpYktHSWp6Vko3Y2ctbVFoeGNUdVVyaC1oMy04RHQtOTRzbkVVWGxWZ19wSU1fZVZPT2I0eU1WZ1M0NmQ4MTFlSTZlczlubDBZYXdyWmlxdm9FQ1VkS08yYjhmWGIyeHhfOA?oc=5","g":["ord"]},{"t":"HCC - Comparison Results","s":"Equitymaster","d":1795296053,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPcFJpVDlYTVUtRFdSRWFFZi1IWE5nVFR0RVd0LV91eUN3RjNoaFJkU3YzTlRybVp3YWRqS1FHdnQ1SWRWcHhuanNndHM2Qld3VE5ucFVVWHNxWm9NRnBhZE9CYkNRSWV0bmRRVWx1QXhfU2VCU0JBbUpnaXNaQlpObmtIM0NPV3ZtY21XOEkxTDlKVkROUDBkYW9kNWQxZnpuU2VMYU5pNEx6WHVORHN3?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Compare with","s":"Equitymaster","d":1795295759,"u":"https://n